      en: ["Offers one of the best views of the capital city, São Tomé.", "The climate here is significantly drier than in the rest of the island.", "Vegetation consists mainly of drought-resistant plants.", "Important location for telecommunication antennas.", "Nearby are the historical Roças Agostinho Neto.", "Popular destination for short excursions from the capital."],
