      en: ["Defined by the constant presence of clouds and fog.", "The temperature here is significantly cooler than in the lowlands.", "Habitat of the endemic São Tomé thrush.", "The soil is extremely rich in organic material.", "The trees capture moisture directly from the clouds (horizontal precipitation).", "Some of the world's rarest orchid species are found here.", "The forest protects the slopes from soil erosion.", "Part of the Obô National Park and strictly protected."],
